DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10488::$$$message_0080_0000_0000$$$::It's lunch break. Time for food.[lr]::
10489::$$$message_0080_0000_0001$$$::As per usual, those who are empty-handed and don't bring lunch like me have infinite possibilities but...[lr]::
10490::$$$message_0080_0000_0002$$$::"Well, the cafeteria is the go-to."::
10491::$$$message_0080_0001_0000$$$::Other rare examples, other than going to the convenience store, would be running to the Mount Miyama shopping district and buying lunch, or going to eat at Shinto and coming back before fifth period.[lr]::
10492::$$$message_0080_0001_0001$$$::Gotou said something like how you've reached peak asceticism if you don't know whether you're going to eat or challenge a time trial.[lr]::
10493::$$$message_0080_0001_0002$$$::I've heard that there are some people who go to hang out in Shinto and completely ditch coming back.::
10494::$$$message_0080_0002_0000$$$::"...That makes sense. I don't think I could go all the way to Shinto and come back to school again..."[lr]::
10495::$$$message_0080_0002_0001$$$::"Hm? What makes sense, Senpai?"[lr]::
10496::$$$message_0080_0002_0002$$$::"Oh, well, going to Shinto for lunch and coming back."[lr]::
10497::$$$message_0080_0002_0003$$$::"That's crazy! You can't do something like that![lr]::
10498::$$$message_0080_0002_0004$$$::No, you don't have to do anything of the sort. I have your lunch too!"::
10499::$$$message_0080_0003_0000$$$::"Wha... Oh, it's you, Sakura.[lr]::
10500::$$$message_0080_0003_0001$$$::No, I was just talking to myself..."[lr]::
10501::$$$message_0080_0003_0002$$$::When I turn, there is a girl holding a bundle wrapped in cloth in her hand.[lr]::
10502::$$$message_0080_0003_0003$$$::...Sakura.[lr]::
10503::$$$message_0080_0003_0004$$$::Could it be that she's planning to go see the cherry blossoms? And skip school?::
10504::$$$message_0080_0004_0000$$$::"I'm glad, [cacheimage storage=桜制服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜制服01c(中) time=300 textoff=0]I was worried that you were really going to push yourself to do something."[lr]::
10505::$$$message_0080_0004_0001$$$::"You're the one who's pushing your[line len=2]no, never mind.[lr]::
10506::$$$message_0080_0004_0002$$$::Sakura, is that lunch?"[lr]::
10507::$$$message_0080_0004_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服08l(中) textoff=0][wait canskip=0 time=400]When I point at it, [chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服09a(中) textoff=0]Sakura nods with delight.[lr]::
10508::$$$message_0080_0004_0004$$$::Hmm, there's quite a lot... So this was the result of her working hard in the kitchen this morning.::
10509::$$$message_0080_0005_0000$$$::"Yes, I was thinking of eating lunch with you."[lr]::
10510::$$$message_0080_0005_0001$$$::"That works out. I didn't have lunch either... Wait, are all three boxes for the two of us?"[lr]::
10511::$$$message_0080_0005_0002$$$::"I was actually thinking that Tohsaka could join us too."[lr]::
10512::$$$message_0080_0005_0003$$$::I see, so that's why there's enough for three people.::
10513::$$$message_0080_0006_0000$$$::"Okay, I'll go get Tohsaka."[lr]::
10514::$$$message_0080_0006_0001$$$::"Oh, it's okay, Senpai. She's already waiting at the rooftop."[lr]::
10515::$$$message_0080_0006_0002$$$::"Got everything figured out, eh? Oh, but what about kyudo club?"[lr]::
10516::$$$message_0080_0006_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服10g(中) textoff=0]Sakura is the captain now, so it seems like she's always having lunch at the archery range...::
10517::$$$message_0080_0007_0000$$$::"I told everyone that I'm having lunch elsewhere today.[lr]::
10518::$$$message_0080_0007_0001$$$::So, with that out of the way, let's head to the roof!"::
10519::$$$message_0080_0008_0000$$$::"Did we make you wait, Sis?"[lr]::
10520::$$$message_0080_0008_0001$$$::The way Sakura calls Tohsaka changes when there's no one watching.[lr]::
10521::$$$message_0080_0008_0002$$$::Tohsaka is waiting at the rooftop with her usual expression.[lr]::
10522::$$$message_0080_0008_0003$$$::I'm sure the other students would flee if they spotted her with that look.::
10523::$$$message_0080_0009_0000$$$::"No, not at all.[lr]::
10524::$$$message_0080_0009_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=凛制服03b(中) pos=l time=300 textoff=0]More than that, you were able to catch Emiya, huh?"[lr]::
10525::$$$message_0080_0009_0002$$$::"There's no way I can turn down Sakura's lunch.[lr]::
10526::$$$message_0080_0009_0003$$$::Plus, I didn't have anything anyway."[lr]::
10527::$$$message_0080_0009_0004$$$::"Me too. Sakura took the time and effort to make it, so I have to share the meal with her."::
10528::$$$message_0080_0010_0000$$$::"Yes, I worked hard so that I can treat you both!"[lr]::
10529::$$$message_0080_0010_0001$$$::Sakura joyfully opens the three stacked lunch boxes.::
10530::$$$message_0080_0011_0000$$$::...You would think of traditional New Year's dishes inside a nest of lacquered boxes, but there is a colorful lineup focused on rice balls. The fish cake is bright red and white.[lr]::
10531::$$$message_0080_0011_0001$$$::We are given chopsticks and serving plates before surrounding the boxes.::
10532::$$$message_0080_0012_0000$$$::"Wow, this is quite something, Sakura. You were able to make this much just this morning, huh?"[lr]::
10533::$$$message_0080_0012_0001$$$::"I was preparing a lot of things since last night. It's more fun to make three servings instead of one, you know?"::
10534::$$$message_0080_0013_0000$$$::I say my thanks and dig right in.[lr]::
10535::$$$message_0080_0013_0001$$$::Having lunch on a rooftop in the fall feels similar to the sort of idyllic image of a picnic.[lr]::
10536::$$$message_0080_0013_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服08l(中),凛制服03a(中) textoff=0]When I chew the rice ball wrapped with seaweed, I can taste a subtle salty flavor. The inside is kelp... Mm, a refined choice.::
10537::$$$message_0080_0014_0000$$$::"This is pretty impressive... I'd never manage in that short a time."[lr]::
10538::$$$message_0080_0014_0001$$$::"Really? I would think that you would be able to make something incredible."[lr]::
10539::$$$message_0080_0014_0002$$$::"...Well, for a different definition of incredible, maybe.[lr]::
10540::$$$message_0080_0014_0003$$$::When it comes to making something myself and eating it... I can only prepare the bare minimum. It's not like I don't want to indulge, but..."::
10541::$$$message_0080_0015_0000$$$::She sighs and nods along with Sakura.[lr]::
10542::$$$message_0080_0015_0001$$$::...She's either developed the habit of saving money, or she's lazy when it comes to herself.[lr]::
10543::$$$message_0080_0015_0002$$$::Despite liking luxurious things, Tohsaka won't waste money.::
10544::$$$message_0080_0016_0000$$$::"Well, I'm not going to go out of my way to change at this point, so it's fine.[lr]::
10545::$$$message_0080_0016_0001$$$::But it means I can't help but get jealous of how efficiently you can prepare lunch for the three of us."[lr]::
10546::$$$message_0080_0016_0002$$$::"That's not true, I'm not attentive to details like you are, so I can only prepare things like this."::
10547::$$$message_0080_0017_0000$$$::"What's wrong with that? It's delicious. Your fried oyster stew is well made, too."[lr]::
10548::$$$message_0080_0017_0001$$$::"There are ways to eat deep-fried food long after it's made. I learned that from Senpai, too."::
10549::$$$message_0080_0018_0000$$$::Even though this side dish is juicy, the broth doesn't leak out and mix the flavors.[lr]::
10550::$$$message_0080_0018_0001$$$::I nod while eating the rolled omelet, impressed. She's better at getting a good balance between the broth and sugar than I am.::
10551::$$$message_0080_0019_0000$$$::"...Hm, hm. All right, since you treated me today, I guess the next round is on me..."[lr]::
10552::$$$message_0080_0019_0001$$$::"Oh, that's good to hear. I'm looking forward to your lunch!"[lr]::
10553::$$$message_0080_0019_0002$$$::"Mrgh... Well, don't get your hopes up too much.[lr]::
10554::$$$message_0080_0019_0003$$$::It's been a while since I made lunch for someone else... Well, I'll try my best to return the favor towards you and Emiya."::
10555::$$$message_0080_0020_0000$$$::The sisters seem to be having fun as they continue conversing.[lr]::
10556::$$$message_0080_0020_0001$$$::Really, they should've been like this for a long time.[lr]::
10557::$$$message_0080_0020_0002$$$::The older sister, Tohsaka, having lunch with her younger sister, Sakura.[lr]::
10558::$$$message_0080_0020_0003$$$::The conversation is lively with idle, everyday things.[lr]::
10559::$$$message_0080_0020_0004$$$::Although the bond that was severed eleven years ago will never return to the way it was.[lr]::
10560::$$$message_0080_0020_0005$$$::But even with its patchwork and needing some more time to heal, it is something to appreciate.::
910528::$$$message_9080_0010_0000$$$::"Yes, I worked hard so that I can treat you both!"[r]:��